# Pairs with NoPhantomAudit. The facade finalizes its record as Committed
# before the store commit, so a commit that then refuses or writes nothing
# leaves a record claiming a change that never happened.
MODULE: AuditEmitBeforeCommit
TARGET: NoPhantomAudit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the final record is written as committed before the commit runs
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
       /\ op' = [op EXCEPT ![o] = [@ EXCEPT !.pc = "returned", !.landed = lands, !.changed = lands, !.live = (r = "undecided"), !.result = r]]
       /\ UNCHANGED <<pending, finals, env>>
--- REPLACE
       /\ op' = [op EXCEPT ![o] = [@ EXCEPT !.pc = "returned", !.landed = lands, !.changed = lands, !.live = (r = "undecided"), !.result = r]]
\* MUTATION: the record is emitted as committed ahead of the commit.
       /\ finals' = finals \cup {Row(o, "Committed", op[o].actor, "caller", op[o].secret, op[o].long)}
       /\ pending' = pending \ {o}
       /\ UNCHANGED env
--- END
